{"3082160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unimaginable Foundation", "steam_appid": 3082160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine a world where the most remarkable technological achievements are hidden by a secretive government organization known as The Unimaginable Foundation. Suppressed from society, these technologies are used in secret to manipulate the public. Human hybrid cloning, fusion power, technological weaponry akin to magic, and AI so advanced it poses <strong>an existential threat to human civilization</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/5bcd69568c25a9b8d7a4d396ca7b0d0f.poster.avif?t=1772863128\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/5bcd69568c25a9b8d7a4d396ca7b0d0f.webm?t=1772863128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/5bcd69568c25a9b8d7a4d396ca7b0d0f.mp4?t=1772863128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as one of the city's finest detectives. During a routine day, you receive a call about a disturbance at the 1st Street Subway station—the same station you know your spouse happens to be using today. Despite the federal government's cordon, you defy the law you swore to uphold to save them. What you find down there is anything but normal. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/1d748a6fb00d9c5eb0124153b4ffecfa.poster.avif?t=1772863128\" width=640 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/1d748a6fb00d9c5eb0124153b4ffecfa.webm?t=1772863128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/1d748a6fb00d9c5eb0124153b4ffecfa.mp4?t=1772863128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into an isometric twin-stick shooter world beneath the city streets as the worst experiments of The Unimaginable Foundation escape their confines. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/24ba2cf125c19ca946155baeca0d3163.poster.avif?t=1772863128\" width=640 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/24ba2cf125c19ca946155baeca0d3163.webm?t=1772863128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/24ba2cf125c19ca946155baeca0d3163.mp4?t=1772863128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve interactive puzzles as you break open the vault of this unraveling mystery. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shooter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/d48a0c5ed78733cf2281d67a954dad9f.poster.avif?t=1772863128\" width=640 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/d48a0c5ed78733cf2281d67a954dad9f.webm?t=1772863128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/d48a0c5ed78733cf2281d67a954dad9f.mp4?t=1772863128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start out with your trusty sidearm and then enhance your character beyond humanity with futuristic weaponry as your foes become deadlier the deeper you go.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interrogation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/9af29ba3488caab917636d99d0a23dbb.poster.avif?t=1772863128\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/9af29ba3488caab917636d99d0a23dbb.webm?t=1772863128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/9af29ba3488caab917636d99d0a23dbb.mp4?t=1772863128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogate allies and enemies you meet on this journey or simply skip them with the pull of a trigger, loosening your morals in pursuit of your goals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/d3164055e5d7e128419f8ae438c2bf14.poster.avif?t=1772863128\" width=640 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/d3164055e5d7e128419f8ae438c2bf14.webm?t=1772863128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/d3164055e5d7e128419f8ae438c2bf14.mp4?t=1772863128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Warped Imagination</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am a solo developer with several decades of experience in the games industry. Join me as I create this game, share its inspirations, and explore the intricacies of game development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Unimaginable Foundation is a passion project that started as an idea in late 2023 and after much community support grew into the game you see today.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine a world where the most remarkable technological achievements are hidden by a secretive government organization known as The Unimaginable Foundation. Suppressed from society, these technologies are used in secret to manipulate the public. Human hybrid cloning, fusion power, technological weaponry akin to magic, and AI so advanced it poses <strong>an existential threat to human civilization</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/5bcd69568c25a9b8d7a4d396ca7b0d0f.poster.avif?t=1772863128\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/5bcd69568c25a9b8d7a4d396ca7b0d0f.webm?t=1772863128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082160/extras/5bcd69568c25a9b8d7a4d396ca7b0d0f.mp4?t=1772863128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as one of the city's finest detectives. During a routine day, you receive a call about a disturbance at the 1st Street Subway station—the same station you know your spouse happens to be using today. Despite the federal government's cordon, you defy the law you swore to uphold to save them. What you find down there is anything but normal. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"htt